    "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAndroidLM offline corpus\n\t\n\nSQLite databases used by AndroidLM, an offline research\nassistant for Android. They are ordinary SQLite files (rollback-journal mode, FTS5) and can be\nopened read-only with any SQLite build that includes FTS5.\n\n\t\n\t\t\nFile\nSize\nContents\n\n\n\t\t\nwiki.db\n21.3GB\nEnglish Wikipedia from the FineWiki extraction (August 2025 HTML dump): 6.05M articles, the 1.87M most-read in full and lead sections for the rest; 38.9M passages of which 31.9M are in a BM25 full-text\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/rammingaway/androidlm-corpus.",
